    "question": "Consider the expression $h(x) = 3x + 12$, which defines the function $h$. The graph of $y = h(x)$ in the $xy$-plane has an $x$-intercept at $(a, 0)$ and a $y$-intercept at $(0, b)$, where $a$ and $b$ are constants. determine the value of $a + b$?",
