    "question": "$f(x) = 45x + 660$\n\nThe function $f$ gives the quarterly fee $f(x)$, in USD, a facility bills to keep $x$ crates in storage. What is the quarterly fee, in USD, the facility bills to keep $53$ crates in storage?",
