    "question": "Two identical rectangular prisms each have a height of $67$ centimeters (cm). The base of each cuboid is a square, and the surface area of each cuboid is $K$ cm$^2$. If the prisms are glued together along a square base, the resulting cuboid has a surface area of $\\frac{54}{17}K$ cm$^2$. What is the edge measurement, in cm, of each square base?",
